Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-gtk4layershell-1.0, libgtk4-layer-shell0, python3-pam, wayfire | labwc, dbus, pulseaudio-utils | pipewire-pulse
Recommends: mako | dunst, mpvpaper, grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, polkit-gnome, pipewire, wireplumber, upower, network-manager
Suggests: gnome-terminal, nautilus, firefox, gnome-calculator, gnome-control-center
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Beeta-inc/os.beeta
Description: Beeta Desktop Environment
 A modern, context-aware Linux desktop environment featuring:
  - Glass UI with backdrop blur (Liquid Glass™)
  - Beeta Adaptive Nature™: environment-aware theming that responds
    to time of day, weather, battery state, and performance mode
  - Beeta Adaptive Motion™: performance-aware animation quality
  - Live Center: dynamic status hub showing media, timers, downloads
  - Desktop/Focus state transitions with auto-hiding bottom bar
  - Wayfire compositor with kawase blur
  - GTK4 panels using Wayland layer-shell protocol
